// Title: Service Started/Stopped Via Wmic.EXE
// ID: 0b7163dc-7eee-4960-af17-c0cd517f92da
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-06-20
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
// Description: Detects usage of wmic to start or stop a service
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAINS " service " AND CommandLine CONTAINS " call ") AND (CommandLine CONTAINS "stopservice" OR CommandLine CONTAINS "startservice")) AND ((OriginalFileName EQ "wmic.exe") OR (Image ENDSWITH "\\WMIC.exe")))
